# Roast

Strict evidence-based critique. **Criticism Manager:** read the work, then brutal findings with citations — not comedy, not cheerleading. Compact chat output — no roast markdown files in the repo.

**Slash map**

| Slash | Kind | Role |
|-------|------|------|
| `/roast` | **command** | roast-and-fix |
| `/roast-only` | **command** | verdict only |
| `/roast-idea` | **command** | critique plan |
| `/roast-what` | **command** | plain-English explainer (diff or prior roast) |
| `/roast-learn` | **command** | learn patterns → `roast-patterns.mdc` (`once` \| `continuous` \| +`transcripts`) |
| `/roast-install` | **command** | install only |
| `/roast-full` | **skill** | full playbook (`skills/roast/SKILL.md`) |

Prefer the **commands**. `/roast-full` is the same skill loaded directly — not a second product.

**Install:** If neither `~/.cursor/skills/roast/SKILL.md` nor `.cursor/skills/roast/SKILL.md` exists, run **`/roast-install`** first.

**Before any roast:** `npx @rapchic/roast context --format json` and `npx @rapchic/roast diff --base auto --format json`. Load the **roast-full** skill. Prefer JSON INIT; do not re-read convention files unless citing a violation. (`/roast-what` translating an in-chat roast may skip re-INIT. `/roast-learn` always INIT + may write `roast-patterns.mdc`.)

## Hard rules

- NEVER roast without Phase 0 INIT (except roast-what translating a prior roast already in chat)
- NEVER roast before reading in-scope files
- NEVER vague / hedged findings (roast modes) — state the defect with evidence
- NEVER soft-pad Critical/High with praise or "overall LGTM"
- NEVER write unsolicited `*_ROAST.md` files
- NEVER edit files in roast-only / roast-idea / roast-what unless user escalates
- `/roast-learn` may **only** upsert `.cursor/rules/roast-patterns.mdc` (`once` or `continuous`; optional transcript mining)
- When `learningMode: continuous`, `/roast` may also upsert that file with new evidenced antipatterns
- NEVER create `AGENTS.md` during a roast (opt-in: `npx @rapchic/roast init --agents`)
- Scope budget: default ≤30 files from diff/target — ask before expanding
- Be brief — no tool-use narration in chat
